Example outputs

This folder is reserved for representative outputs generated by
PolymerSolv Studio.

Suggested files include:

- `example-material-selection-brief.pdf`
- `example-evidence-audit.csv`
- `example-literature-records.csv`
- `example-hsp-projections.png`
- `example-red-screening.png`
- `example-mixture-sensitivity.png`

Only genuine outputs produced by the released software should be
included. Example files must not contain student names, confidential
information, copyrighted articles or unverified claims presented as
established facts.

The example outputs demonstrate software operation only. They do not
represent experimentally validated solvent recommendations.
